{"id":"C277f327dfe043b0eb8da","zh":"扭曲","en":"track twist irregularity","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"轨道两轨相对高差沿线路方向变化所形成的不平顺类型。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"以两轨相对高差沿线路的变化为分析对象，用于轨道区段不平顺诊断，也可作为列车车体振动状态预测中的轨道几何输入，联系轨道状态与车辆振动表现。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C277f327dfe043b0eb8da","zh":"扭曲","en":"track twist irregularity","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H78e3f711d377c5167166","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 徐磊等（2014）"}],"designations":[{"id":"Dae0e3d613331afa4385e","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"扭曲"},{"id":"D748050ea2c97af9b5e38","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"track twist irregularity"}],"sources":{"P103":{"id":"P103","title":"轨道不平顺作用下铁路列车车体振动状态的PCA-SVM预测分析","authors":"徐磊,陈宪麦","year":"2014","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8361.2014.07.003","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2014）","overview_slug":"2014-pca-svm-forecast-of-car-body-vibration-states-of-railway-locomotives-and-vehicles-under-the-action-o"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"S7111b5f8c5aac9a35d10","source_id":"P103","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"对轨道检查车多次实地检测的数据采用PCA-SVM分类器计算的分析结果表明:绝对均值、方根均值、方根幅值等主要轨道不平顺统计参数控制车体的整体振动状态,其他特征参数起调节车体振动的作用;采用扭曲和水平不平顺作为预测模型的输入,可使车体振动状态的测算准确率达到90%以上。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S1e9194b244771a91cc91","source_id":"P103","page":6,"page_end":6,"language":"zh","text":"从表3可知,采用轨道扭曲不平顺和水平不平顺得到的车体振动加速度绝对峰值各状态的预测精度要远高于采用轨道高低不平顺和方向不平顺所得到的预测精度。","citations":[{"source_id":"P103","page":6,"page_end":6}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C7faa91e7f203494b6fcc","target_concept_id":"C7faa91e7f203494b6fcc","target_zh":"车体振动加速度","target_en":"car-body vibration acceleration","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C4da328d3dc09ffab5ba3","target_concept_id":"C4da328d3dc09ffab5ba3","target_zh":"高低不平顺","target_en":"vertical profile irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C400c31c2498e694642f1","target_concept_id":"C400c31c2498e694642f1","